    "name": "Weather & Flight-Booking API Test Suite",
    "description": "Comprehensive automated API test suite covering Weather Telemetry, Forecast Projections, Hazard Alerts, Flight Scheduling, Seat Reservations, Concurrency Collisions, and Aviation Weather Advisories.",
